        text: This is pretty nice, thanks.
        effect: 0
      - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
        text: "Glad to hear. I assumed you\u2019d enjoy some apple flavor since healing
